      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY ULTIMATE HENRY (7) afetr racing outside the leader for the entire trip finished sixth last start over 2190m at Mildura, beaten 15 metres, after having placed second at the previous appearance over 1790m at Mildura. Drawn to enjoy a nice run, with luck possibly playing a role at some point. Finds a nice race and can turn things around. LOCHINVAR RULER (2) was unplaced two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he broke and finished 24 metres away in sixth over 1800m at Globe Derby Park. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Big chance if he behaves in this similar assignment. CAPTAIN PAPRIKA (5) disappointed last time when seventh over 2190m at Mildura. Can atone. WELL WELL (3) is the best of the rest after finishing fifth over 1609m at Port Pirie last time out after having raced in behind the leader at the bell.",
